CM_ BO_ 257 "Command frame 0x101. TargetRaw is mode-dependent: current=mA, speed=mdps, position=mdeg. Timeout raw unit is 10ms; zero uses configured CAN timeout.";
CM_ BO_ 513 "Fast telemetry 0x201. Position is signed millidegrees, speed raw is mdps/100, current raw is mA/10.";
CM_ BO_ 577 "Power and temperature telemetry 0x241. Derate raw 1000 means 100%.";
CM_ BO_ 641 "Status telemetry 0x281. CommandAge is capped at 2.55s by the firmware.";
CM_ BO_ 769 "Current debug telemetry 0x301. Instant and filtered currents are signed mA.";
CM_ BO_ 833 "Control debug telemetry 0x341. Duty raw is signed permille.";
CM_ SG_ 641 Flags "Bit 0=enabled, bit 1=PWM valid, bit 2=I2C valid, bit 3=analog valid, bit 6=current calibrated.";
CM_ SG_ 641 Faults "Bit 0=EStop, 1=overcurrent, 2=overtemp, 3=temp sensor, 4=bus undervoltage, 5=bus overvoltage, 6=position, 7=magnet, 8=angle mismatch, 9=CAN timeout, 10=PWM timeout, 11=ADC not ready, 12=CAN overflow, 13=config.";

